Package: liberrex-monitoring-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Feres Mrad <mohamed.feres.mrad@liberrex.com>
Description: Liberrex Monitoring Agent
 System and service monitoring agent that collects
 metrics from CPU, memory, disk, network, SSH sessions,
 and Apache services, then sends them to a centralized
 InfluxDB/VictoriaLogs instances for monitoring and alerting.
